@@ -0,0 +1,31 @@
+# MASTER7 v156 member frontend polish
+
+Release: `17.0.0-selfbuilt.156-member-polish`
+
+This release gives the customer portal one consistent water-blue, blue and
+white presentation while preserving every existing availability and money
+control.
+
+- Mobile member services use four large, readable Deposit, Withdraw, Games
+  and Support entrances instead of a compressed menu.
+- The company hero is shorter on mobile, the game-lobby heading has stronger
+  contrast, and provider artwork, cards, spacing and typography share stable
+  proportions.
+- The bottom navigation grows to a touch-friendly height, adapts to four or
+  five visible destinations and leaves safe page clearance above it.
+- Sponsored providers remain independent, horizontally scrollable placements
+  with a visible three-position cue.
+- Mobile payment profiles are compact single-column rows with clearer labels.
+- The retired Android APK promotion is removed from the member sign-in flow.
+- Public catalogue wording uses customer-facing availability such as
+  `Coming soon` and `Play coming soon`; internal API state labels and the
+  `0 CONNECTED` counter are no longer presented as customer features.
+
+At 393 px viewport width the page remains 393 px wide with no horizontal
+overflow. The primary service buttons measure about 180 × 119 px, the mobile
+dock is 70 px high and the compact brand hero is 237 px high.
+
+This release does not enable games, deposits, payouts or real-money
+operations. Supplier acceptance, launch, wallet, settlement and production
+evidence remain required before Play can be enabled. Payment channels and
+their operational flags remain unchanged.
